OL,3,AAI staff 'genuinely frightened' for
OL,4,Ahumanity's future, ex-Anthropic
OL,5,Aresearcher tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn artificial intelligence researcher
OL,8,Fwho quit AI firm Anthropic has said
OL,9,Fpeople working on the technology were
OL,10,F"genuinely frightened" about the speed
OL,11,Fof its advancements and what it could
OL,12,Fmean for humanity.
OL,14,F"I believe that if we don't slow down
OL,15,Fat the current rate of progress, there
OL,16,Fis a strong chance that we could all
OL,17,Fdie in the immediate future," he said.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
