OL,3,ASix dead, 107 rescued from Indonesian
OL,4,Aferry that went missing in Java Sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people have died and 107 have been
OL,7,Frescued from a stricken Indonesian
OL,8,Fpassenger ferry in the Java Sea,
OL,9,FIndonesia's search and rescue agency
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FA search and rescue operation was
OL,13,Flaunched after contact was lost with
OL,14,Fthe Virgo Transport 8 ship, which was
OL,15,Fcarrying 243 people, as it encountered
OL,16,Fbad weather, Indonesia's search and
OL,17,Frescue agency said.
OL,19,FThe search for the remaining passengers
OL,20,Fis ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
